flowchart TD
    Owner[Pet owner] --> UI[Streamlit interface]

    subgraph SchedulingWorkflow[Deterministic scheduling workflow]
        UI --> PetTaskData[Pet and task data]
        PetTaskData --> Validation[Pet and task validation]
        Validation --> Models[Owner, Pet, and Task models]
        Models --> Scheduler[Rule-based scheduler]
        Scheduler --> Plan[Daily plan]
        Scheduler --> Explanation[Plan explanations]
        Models --> Conflict[Conflict detection]
        Conflict --> Warnings[Conflict warnings]
        Plan --> Review[Human review]
        Explanation --> Review
        Warnings --> Review
        Review --> UI
    end

    subgraph RAGWorkflow[Retrieval-augmented AI workflow]
        UI --> Question[Pet-care question]
        Question --> QValidation[Question validation]
        QValidation --> Retriever[TF-IDF cosine retriever]
        Retriever --> KnowledgeBase[Markdown knowledge base]
        KnowledgeBase --> Chunks[Relevant document chunks]
        Chunks --> Prompt[Retrieved context plus pet context]
        Prompt --> Gemini[Gemini 2.5 Flash API]
        Gemini --> Answer[Grounded answer]
        Answer --> Sources[Source attribution]
        Sources --> HumanReview[Human review]
        HumanReview --> UI
    end

    Guardrails[Guardrails and error handling] -. Missing key, invalid question, missing files, irrelevant retrieval, timeout, rate limit, invalid response .-> UI
    Retriever -. No relevant passage .-> Guardrails
    Gemini -. API failure or invalid response .-> Guardrails

    Logging[Structured logging] -. Retrieval events and errors, no API keys or questions .-> Retriever
    Logging -. API and model errors .-> Gemini

    Tests[Automated pytest suite] --> SchedulerTests[Scheduler and UI tests]
    Tests --> RAGTests[Retrieval, prompt, source, and failure tests]
    Tests --> Evaluation[10-case Hit at 3 evaluation]
    Evaluation --> Results[tests/test_results.txt]
